{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a2f6a974b0a7d260e850f324cb0a2ad7d05c36236f16d00e7f2c2bb846eeadc7", "ja": "（風花がブログで公開した写真が、非常に好評だ。\nそれを伝えたくて、本人を探しているんだけど……）", "zh": "（风花在部落格公开的照片大受好评。\n我想把这件事跟她说，目前正在找她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a5a55ee20d0a8ae498fbcaa9515488dc3d572e6f5625ae01d2fb74f364ab82db", "ja": "風花……あ、いたいた。\nん？　どうして水着なんか着てるんだ？", "zh": "风花……啊，找到了。\n嗯？你怎么穿着泳装啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "96ad181b08217a2be6e86294deae8874059a21931c6079ea6e94625e9f18430f", "ja": "きゃっ！？　{$P$}さん、\nち、ちょっと待ってください！", "zh": "呀啊！？{$P$}先生，\n请、请等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e29ca25c48a07b794d98169a3131e634fe8ed4b5f163b6b4f716362d3aa9b124", "ja": "うぅ……まさかこんなところを、\n{$P$}さんに見られちゃうなんて。", "zh": "呜呜……没想到会被{$P$}先生\n看到我这副模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "34017c0e04881afa30ac87c023dcd242404e06064724cfa98428f259a11e6c5f", "ja": "もう！\n来るなら来るって、先に言っておいてください～！", "zh": "讨厌！\n你要来应该先跟我说啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1005_p", "source_sha256": "67af56f2371f48486b03653560277f85b74096623eb98b10589294efe82e1b47", "ja": "ご、ごめん……でも、ちょうどよかった。\nその衣装の水着の事で、話したい事があったんだ。", "zh": "抱、抱歉……不过，关于那件泳装，\n我正好有事想跟你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d23e46891b95f40278f69d3662006274943159b3a718e54ba3f6100b08b3176b", "ja": "え？　この衣装が、どうかしたんですか……？", "zh": "咦？这件泳装怎么了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5b2691d6f3f2f15bdaceb760f604f266f71186aa31e1626bd5ee05edaa35693f", "ja": "ほら、ブログにその水着姿の写真を公開しただろ？\nそれにたくさん反応があってな。", "zh": "你不是在部落格上公开了穿泳装的照片吗？\n粉丝的反应非常热烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1008_p", "source_sha256": "aa85e6f15421bf0afdfc8abeede2ff0659b6d257859d2b3d5f10d177f2a43f68", "ja": "かなり評判が良くて……映画での、風花の活躍に\n期待している声も多かったぞ！", "zh": "大家评价都非常高……\n也都很期待看到风花在电影里大显身手喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d3cbb0e57e81c679bba15cef790d482570e67def32db1ec47dbc48b18bb1c42c", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか！？　よかったぁ……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗！？太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1807c71eba3eb2a82ca115f1454d5c34dc23bb5cc68398e3d988ab24eaeda8bd", "ja": "衣装とはいえ、自分のブログに水着写真を載せる\nなんてって、ちょっとドキドキしたんですけど……。", "zh": "虽说是表演的服装，但要在自己的部落格\n放穿泳装的照片，还是让我有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "202971a64436fde79e9292fadbe9e564584bc9c3ab3cc5f215817bd7a84eaf00", "ja": "でも、映画に期待してもらえたのなら、\n思いきって載せてみて正解でしたね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "不过，能让大家期待电影的上映，\n看来我下定决心放上照片是对的！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6b6c2895550afc56b4803a365330e0e2b8a58e1a326b2acea0a33b6ff4ee90b3", "ja": "（映画にセクシーショットを期待している声も\n多少届いていたが、それはおいておこう……）", "zh": "（虽然也有些人期待电影里会有性感镜头，\n但这还是别跟她说好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1013_p", "source_sha256": "668e196f7385d1645dd453ae72c047447212ca01c82f420648b47798bce184e6", "ja": "でも、どうして急に水着なんか着てたんだ？\n撮影は全部終わったし、次に着る予定は……。", "zh": "不过，你为什么会突然换上泳装？\n拍摄工作都已经结束了，下次要穿的时间是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3d5caf1c020489dd32de167002aea0b077ee9039b341e0553237089b1801acb5", "ja": "えっと……それは、そのぉ……。", "zh": "呃……这是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "349e8b670462915d1b31b8797ab5d61756adf5b2ff4e1d8d0b965ad91d893d1a", "ja": "映画が完成したら、し、試写会とか、舞台挨拶とか\nあるじゃないですか。それで……。", "zh": "电影完成以后，不、不是还有试映会、\n见面会之类的活动吗？所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1df3e063ac709b1deed873852523d79c0d311aaf31e82e0d6932e7b93170a212", "ja": "もし、この衣装で出てって言われたら、\nどうしようかなと思って……。", "zh": "到时候要是得穿这套服装出席，\n该如何是好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "42c24138dd762b5847302b27175e80b36c2b9438718b8ae20a0d2d8cfa414ad4", "ja": "撮影が終わって、気が抜けていたので……体重とか、\nちょっと増えちゃったかもしれないから……その……。", "zh": "因为拍摄的行程都结束了，我有点松懈……\n体重之类的可能会增加一些……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1019_p", "source_sha256": "587f28b8d444802e99cfe0c8b744df5908184feed40806fd6c2746ad6a6431a6", "ja": "なるほど。それで、スタイルをチェックしていたと。", "zh": "我懂了，所以你是在确认身材有没有走样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2cb5743b1fb677d2a4e7b00aa7bf3392195e1015a4075821e455ad6d0b40e9ba", "ja": "は、ハッキリ言わないでください～！\n……でも、そうです……うう、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "别、别说得这么直白啦～！\n……不过，就是这样……呜呜，好难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3645dd496137540d454598931983b7a1d031c1a83631f423597d9a54268d4c1c", "ja": "まあまあ。\nでも、風花の気持ちはわかったよ。", "zh": "没事没事。\n不过，我明白风花的想法了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "25ed2b5c9ff406d8a3fb596190b541023b2719cc7d821c05392f47124e0c9311", "ja": "え？　私の気持ちって……\n{$P$}さん？", "zh": "咦？明白我的想法……\n{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1023_p", "source_sha256": "af0eb58cd05b2dc46ab0e243a83ac8b8824add9089ecc126f401c980b707bc31", "ja": "映画に対する風花の熱意、伝わったよ。監督に、\n「舞台挨拶はぜひ水着で」って、お願いしておくよ！", "zh": "风花对电影的热忱，我都感受到了。\n我会拜托导演，跟他说「举办见面会时一定要穿泳装」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9c68a23e6299100bf7729ff1b012112785c0a837b3a88b5d17d56fd156651846", "ja": "ええ～！？　{$P$}さん、\nそうじゃなくて！　私、水着に積極的なわけじゃ……！", "zh": "咦咦～！？{$P$}先生，你误会了！\n我没有那么积极想穿泳装……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0074_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0d40f888f6e3fca2c59631a180ab5a9501bc5286d36325bebbc2a836a54ee8a6", "ja": "うぅ……なんでこうなっちゃうの～？", "zh": "呜呜……怎么会变成这样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
